===Etymology===
Modern {{etyl|el|en}} {{m|el|σπανακόπιτα}}, from {{m|el|σπανάκι||spinach}} + {{m|el|πίτα||pie}}. Usually short for {{m|el|σπανακοτυρόπιτα||spanakotiropita, spinach and cheese pie}}, from {{m|el|τυρί||cheese}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-us-spanakopita.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# (Usually short for [[spanakotiropita]]) A Greek dish made with pre-cooked [[spinach]], butter, olive oil, cheese, [[green onion]]s, [[egg]] and seasoning in [[phyllo pastry]].
# The same or similar dishes made without cheese.

